    <h1 class="tm-article-title"><span class="tm-lang" lang="da">Forsendelse &amp; levering</span><span class="tm-lang" lang="en">Shipping &amp; delivery</span></h1>
    <p class="tm-article-sub"><span class="tm-lang" lang="da">Leveringstider, fragtpriser og hvad der sker, når din pakke er på vej.</span><span class="tm-lang" lang="en">Delivery times, shipping costs and what happens when your parcel is on its way.</span></p>
  </div>
</div>

<article class="tm-article">
  <nav class="tm-breadcrumb"><a href="/hc/"><span class="tm-lang" lang="da">Hjælpecenter</span><span class="tm-lang" lang="en">Help Center</span></a> / <span class="tm-lang" lang="da">Forsendelse &amp; levering</span><span class="tm-lang" lang="en">Shipping &amp; delivery</span></nav>

  <div class="tm-lang" lang="da">
  <p>Alle ordrer sendes fra vores centrallager i Tyskland – Europas største musiklager. Varer markeret <strong>på lager</strong>, som bestilles før kl. 15.00 på en hverdag, afsendes normalt samme dag.</p>

  <div class="tm-callout">
    <strong>Gratis forsendelse</strong> på ordrer fra 1.100 kr til Danmark. Under det koster standardforsendelse 89 kr pr. ordre, uanset hvor mange varer du køber.
  </div>

  <h2>Leveringstider til Danmark</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Standardpakke:</strong> 2–4 hverdage efter afsendelse.</li>
    <li><strong>Express:</strong> 1–2 hverdage – kan vælges i kassen for lagervarer.</li>
    <li><strong>Voluminøs fragt</strong> (klaverer, store PA-anlæg, trommesæt): 4–7 hverdage, leveret af en fragtmand, der ringer og aftaler tidspunkt.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Fragtfirmaer</h2>
  <p>Pakker leveres af GLS eller PostNord afhængigt af størrelse og destination. Du vælger hjemmelevering eller pakkeshop i kassen og kan ændre leveringspræferencen på fragtfirmaets track & trace-side, når pakken er afsendt.</p>

  <h2>Beskadiget eller manglende pakke</h2>
  <p>Tjek venligst pakken, før du kvitterer for den. Er emballagen synligt beskadiget, så notér det over for chaufføren og tag et billede. <a href="/hc/requests/new">Kontakt os</a> derefter inden for 7 dage med billederne og dit ordrenummer – vi håndterer sagen med fragtfirmaet og sender en erstatning.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="tm-lang" lang="en">
  <p>All orders are shipped from our central warehouse in Germany – Europe's largest music warehouse. Items marked <strong>in stock</strong> that are ordered before 15:00 on a weekday usually leave the same day.</p>

  <div class="tm-callout">
    <strong>Free shipping</strong> on orders from 1,100 kr to Denmark. Below that, standard shipping costs 89 kr per order, no matter how many items you buy.
  </div>

  <h2>Delivery times to Denmark</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Standard parcel:</strong> 2–4 working days after shipping.</li>
    <li><strong>Express:</strong> 1–2 working days – available at checkout for in-stock items.</li>
    <li><strong>Bulky freight</strong> (pianos, large PA systems, drum kits): 4–7 working days, delivered by a freight forwarder who calls to arrange a time.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Carriers</h2>
  <p>Parcels are delivered by GLS or PostNord depending on size and destination. You can choose home delivery or a parcel shop at checkout, and change the delivery preference in the carrier's tracking page once the parcel has been shipped.</p>

  <h2>Damaged or missing parcel</h2>
  <p>Please check the parcel before signing for it. If the packaging is visibly damaged, note it with the driver and take a photo. Then <a href="/hc/requests/new">contact us</a> within 7 days with the photos and your order number – we handle the claim with the carrier and send a replacement.</p>
  </div>

